<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Context-Free on 0x32++</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/context-free/</link><description>Recent content in Context-Free on 0x32++</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 03 Dec 2009 19:28:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.0x32.co.uk/tags/context-free/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Crystal 5</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/crystal-5/</link><pubDate>Thu, 03 Dec 2009 19:28:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/crystal-5/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4132805021/" title="Crystal 5 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2663/4132805021_76759a60f6.jpg" width="500" height="500" alt="Crystal 5" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Created with Context Free&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:85%;"&gt;Alastair&amp;rsquo;s Fractals &lt;a href="http://alsfractals.blogspot.com/"&gt;Main Page&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.cafepress.com/alastair_hm"&gt;My Shop at CafePress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://www.zazzle.com/doodle_m*"&gt;My Shop at Zazzle&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/28ufx8"&gt;Sign My Guestbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/yofz2a"&gt;&lt;img src="http://tinyurl.com/ysfcth" alt="In association with Zazzle.com" border="0" height="57" width="141" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;© Alastair Montgomery 2008&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>From Crystals to Spirals</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/from-crystals-to-spirals/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2009 12:43:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/from-crystals-to-spirals/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Initial Design&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4127542405/" title="Crystal 1 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2800/4127542405_cb1cb2f435.jpg" width="500" height="500" alt="Crystal 1" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Created with this script&lt;br /&gt;&lt;code&gt;startshape crystals&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystals {&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 }&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 90}&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 180} &lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 270}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystal {&lt;br /&gt;blob {}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 y 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 x 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule blob {&lt;br /&gt;SQUARE {}&lt;br /&gt; blob {s 0.9 b - 0.1 r 5}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Add an extra layer of recursion&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4127543097/" title="Crystal 2 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2600/4127543097_1b9aef2bce.jpg" width="500" height="500" alt="Crystal 2" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;code&gt;startshape gem&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule gem{&lt;br /&gt;crystals {}&lt;br /&gt;gem { s 0.8 r 10 }&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystals {&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 }&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 90}&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 180} &lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 270}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystal {&lt;br /&gt;blob {}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 y 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 x 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule blob {&lt;br /&gt;SQUARE {}&lt;br /&gt; blob {s 0.9 b - 0.1 r 5}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Or with this change create a spiral effect&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4127543597/" title="Crystal 3 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2613/4127543597_4d895b0040.jpg" width="500" height="500" alt="Crystal 3" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;code&gt;startshape gems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule gems{&lt;br /&gt;8 * {r 45} gem {}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule gem{&lt;br /&gt;crystals {}&lt;br /&gt;gem { s 0.8 r 10 x 2.5}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystals {&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 }&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 90}&lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 180} &lt;br /&gt;crystal { h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000 r 270}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystal {&lt;br /&gt;blob {}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 y 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 x 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule blob {&lt;br /&gt;SQUARE {}&lt;br /&gt; blob {s 0.9 b - 0.1 r 5}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Finally add some colour and change the angle&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4130963452/" title="Crystal 4 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2773/4130963452_3a3b66deb1.jpg" width="500" height="500" alt="Crystal 4" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;code&gt;startshape gems&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule gems{&lt;br /&gt;8 * {r 45} gem {h 81.87 sat 0.8642 b 1.0000}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule gem{&lt;br /&gt;crystals {}&lt;br /&gt;gem { s 0.8 r 25 x 2.5 h +25}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystals {&lt;br /&gt;crystal { }&lt;br /&gt;crystal { r 90}&lt;br /&gt;crystal { r 180} &lt;br /&gt;crystal { r 270}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule crystal {&lt;br /&gt;blob {}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 y 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;crystal {s 0.5 x 0.75}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule blob {&lt;br /&gt;SQUARE {}&lt;br /&gt; blob {s 0.9 b - 0.1 r 5}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:85%;"&gt;Alastair&amp;rsquo;s Fractals &lt;a href="http://alsfractals.blogspot.com/"&gt;Main Page&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.cafepress.com/alastair_hm"&gt;My Shop at CafePress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://www.zazzle.com/doodle_m*"&gt;My Shop at Zazzle&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/28ufx8"&gt;Sign My Guestbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/yofz2a"&gt;&lt;img src="http://tinyurl.com/ysfcth" alt="In association with Zazzle.com" border="0" height="57" width="141" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Fractal tree with spikes</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/fractal-tree-with-spikes/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2009 14:09:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/fractal-tree-with-spikes/</guid><description>&lt;style type="text/css"&gt;.flickr-photo { border: solid 2px #000000; }.flickr-yourcomment { }.flickr-frame { text-align: left; padding: 3px; }.flickr-caption { font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 0px; }&lt;/style&gt;&lt;div class="flickr-frame"&gt; &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4119139089/" title="photo sharing"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2583/4119139089_fbd5d53089.jpg" class="flickr-photo" alt="" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class="flickr-caption"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4119139089/"&gt;Fractal tree with spikes&lt;/a&gt;, originally uploaded by &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/people/doodle_m/"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt; Fractal tree created in &lt;a href="http://www.contextfreeart.org/"&gt;Context Free&lt;/a&gt; using the script below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;startshape trees&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule trees {&lt;br /&gt;tree {hue =1 sat =0.8016 b =0.9502}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule tree {&lt;br /&gt;spike {}&lt;br /&gt;tree {y 2 s 0.7 r 30 hue +5}&lt;br /&gt;tree {y 2 s 0.7 r -30 hue +5}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule spike {&lt;br /&gt;point {}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule point {&lt;br /&gt;CIRCLE {}&lt;br /&gt;point { y 0.1 s 0.96 sat -0.005 }&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/code&gt;</description></item><item><title>Context Free Spikes</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/context-free-spikes/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2009 11:51:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/context-free-spikes/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;More &lt;a href="http://www.contextfreeart.org/"&gt;context free&lt;/a&gt; art&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4118942337/" title="Spikes 4 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2548/4118942337_5f0c115213.jpg" width="394" height="500" alt="Spikes 4" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4119716944/" title="Spikes 4 version 2 by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2802/4119716944_6b692ca419.jpg" width="500" height="460" alt="Spikes 4 version 2" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here is the script, just change the &amp;ldquo;r -40&amp;rdquo; to &amp;ldquo;r 40&amp;rdquo; to generate the other image.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;startshape spin2&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule spin2 {&lt;br /&gt;spin {}&lt;br /&gt;spin2 { r -40 x 1.5 y 1 s 0.9}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule spin {&lt;br /&gt;spikes {}&lt;br /&gt;}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule spikes { spike {hue =1 sat =0.8016 b =0.9502} }&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule spike { point { } spike { r 10 s 0.95 hue +1 } }&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;rule point { CIRCLE{} point { y 0.1 s 0.96 sat -0.005 }}&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:85%;"&gt;Alastair&amp;rsquo;s Fractals &lt;a href="http://alsfractals.blogspot.com/"&gt;Main Page&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.cafepress.com/alastair_hm"&gt;My Shop at CafePress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://www.zazzle.com/doodle_m*"&gt;My Shop at Zazzle&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/28ufx8"&gt;Sign My Guestbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/yofz2a"&gt;&lt;img src="http://tinyurl.com/ysfcth" alt="In association with Zazzle.com" border="0" height="57" width="141" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Context free tree edit</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/context-free-tree-edit/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2009 12:21:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/context-free-tree-edit/</guid><description>&lt;style type="text/css"&gt;.flickr-photo { border: solid 2px #000000; }.flickr-yourcomment { }.flickr-frame { text-align: left; padding: 3px; }.flickr-caption { font-size: 0.8em; margin-top: 0px; }&lt;/style&gt;&lt;div class="flickr-frame"&gt; &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4117369790/" title="photo sharing"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2608/4117369790_92718aba2f.jpg" class="flickr-photo" alt="" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span class="flickr-caption"&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4117369790/"&gt;Context free tree edit&lt;/a&gt;, originally uploaded by &lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/people/doodle_m/"&gt;Alastair Montgomery&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt; Created with &lt;a href="http://www.contextfreeart.org/"&gt;Context Free&lt;/a&gt; and edited in the Gimp&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Script used to create this below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt;startshape forest&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt;rule forest {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt;4 * {r 90} trees {}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="flickr-yourcomment"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-family:'courier new';"&gt;&lt;span class="Apple-style-span" style="font-size:small;"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Context Free Fractal Trees</title><link>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/context-free-fractal-trees/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2009 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://blog.0x32.co.uk/posts/context-free-fractal-trees/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4111863091/" title="Context Free Tree by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2803/4111863091_ca5945acd0.jpg" width="500" height="499" alt="Context Free Tree" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Context Free Fractal Tree created with the &lt;a href="http://www.contextfreeart.org/"&gt;Context Free&lt;/a&gt; software&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4114952846/" title="Fractal Tree by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2691/4114952846_4420b98b84.jpg" width="500" height="466" alt="Fractal Tree" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4115144378/" title="Grey Tree by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2770/4115144378_3dcfa30c5c.jpg" width="500" height="499" alt="Grey Tree" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/doodle_m/4114375681/" title="Tree Curl by Alastair Montgomery, on Flickr"&gt;&lt;img src="http://farm3.static.flickr.com/2717/4114375681_5397e48ff9.jpg" width="479" height="500" alt="Tree Curl" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:85%;"&gt;Alastair&amp;rsquo;s Fractals &lt;a href="http://alsfractals.blogspot.com/"&gt;Main Page&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.cafepress.com/alastair_hm"&gt;My Shop at CafePress&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://www.zazzle.com/doodle_m*"&gt;My Shop at Zazzle&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/28ufx8"&gt;Sign My Guestbook&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;a href="http://tinyurl.com/yofz2a"&gt;&lt;img src="http://tinyurl.com/ysfcth" alt="In association with Zazzle.com" border="0" height="57" width="141" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;© Alastair Montgomery 2008&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>